        "cooked": "<p>Oh yeah. My mistake the first time was activating Red Right Hand on the first Regeneration, when Medico really needed the HP. Holding off until he’d had a round to get back into double digits and then playing another one, <em>then</em> activating RRH turned him into Doctor Murdico. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slight_smile.png?v=12\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\"> Having Guise copy his stuff was just icing on the cake.</p>",
